BARE KINGS — is the 0-node result from the REPETITION or from INSUFFICIENT MATERIAL?

  no moves at all          : ('cp', 0, 0) a1b1
  1 cycle (2 occurrences)  : ('cp', 0, 0) a1b1
  2 cycles (3 occurrences) : ('cp', 0, 0) a1b1

